{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-add039","title":"邓千秋先卒，其二子死于火灾","order":5714,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-add039","label":"世语","text":"邓千秋先卒，其二子死于火灾","evidence":["wgc-q0686","wgc-q0125"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0096","role":"此前去世","evidence":["wgc-q0686","wgc-q0125"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0686","wgc-q0125"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0686"}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0096","name":"邓千秋","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0125","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6042821b45101ef15ac7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“咸宁中，积射将军樊震为西戎牙门，得见辞，武帝问震所由进；震自陈，曾为邓艾伐蜀时帐下将。帝遂寻问艾，震具申艾之忠，言之流涕。先是以艾孙朗为丹水令，由此迁为定陵令。次孙千秋有时望，光禄大夫王戎辟为掾。永嘉中，朗为新都太守，未之官；在襄阳失火，朗及母、妻、子举室烧死，惟子韬、子行得免。千秋先卒，二子亦烧死。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-eb8e172102a1d53631b6","start":0,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0686","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6042821b45101ef15ac7","layer":"pei","quote":"千秋先卒，二子亦烧死。","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-eb8e172102a1d53631b6","start":150,"end":161,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
